@* Inbox is upstream of Tasks and Devbook (see
   .devbook/domain/context-map.md): it publishes what it triaged and never reads the
   other two back. Now that the Inbox is its own project these imports are the
   project's own rather than inherited from the desktop app, so the control
   namespaces its pane renders have to be named here, and so does its own
   module's published surface. Still deliberately free of every other context
   namespace — every line beyond the shared library and Inbox.Abstractions
   would be a boundary crossed. *@
